 text-xs [&amp;_a]:underline pb-2 hide-during-screenshot"><p>Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v4.3.2<!-- --> includes: <!-- -->AA-Briefcase v1.1, GDPval-AA v2.1, AutomationBench-AA, Terminal-Bench 4.0, SciCode, Humanity&#x27;s Last Exam, GDP.pdf, CritPt, AA-Omniscience, AA-LCR v1.1<!-- -->. See<!-- --> <a href="/methodology/intelligence-benchmarking">Intelligence Index methodology</a> for further details, including a breakdown of each evaluation and how we run them.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_i38ltabsrb_-trigger-intelligence-vs-time-per-task" hidden="" id="radix-_R_i38ltabsrb_-content-intelligence-vs-time-per-task" tabindex="0" class="mt-0 ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 p-4"></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_i38ltabsrb_-trigger-intelligence-vs-output-tokens-per-task" hidden="" id="radix-_R_i38ltabsrb_-content-intelligence-vs-output-tokens-per-task" tabindex="0" class="mt-0 ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 p-4"></div></div></div></section><div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><div dir="ltr" data-orientation="horizontal" id="release-comparison-tabs" class="scroll-mt-24 border rounded-lg"><div class="w-full overflow-x-auto border-b py-3 bg-neutral-50 px-1 light-scrollbar rounded-t-lg"><div role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="h-9 rounded-lg bg-brand-blue-light p-1 text-neutral-500 relative min-w-full !bg-transparent !p-0 !rounded-none !border-0 !shadow-none !h-auto justify-start inline-flex items-center" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" style="outline:none"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="radix-_R_158ltabsrb_-content-int