enodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1mcif8ltabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_mcif8ltabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="text-sm" data-metric-descriptor-content="true" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="invisible grid grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 [[data-state=open]&gt;&amp;]:visible [[data-state=open]&gt;&amp;]:grid-rows-[1fr] [[data-state=open]&gt;&amp;]:opacity-100"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="pt-0 text-xs [&amp;_a]:underline pb-2 hide-during-screenshot"><p>Share of AA-AnalystAgent questions answered correctly on all five attempts. AA-AnalystAgent is Artificial Analysis&#x27; benchmark for end-to-end quantitative analysis on real-world spreadsheets and documents; every question is run five independent times, so pass^5 measures how reliably a model reproduces a correct answer rather than how often it reaches one.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h3 class="text-2xl font-brand-serif flex items-baseline gap-2"><a class="hover:underline underline-offset-4" href="/evaluations/omniscience">AA-Omniscience</a></h3><p class="text-sm max-w-[60ch]">AA-Omniscience is a knowledge and hallucination benchmark that rewards accuracy, punishes bad guesses and provides a comprehensive view of which models produce factually reliable outputs across different domains</p></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border"><div dir="ltr" data-orientation="horizontal" id="omniscience-tabs" class="scroll-mt-24"><div class="w-full overflow-x-auto border-b py-3 bg-neutral-50 px-1 light-scrollbar"><div role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="h-9 rounded-lg bg-brand-blue-light p-1 text-neutral-500 relative min-w-full !bg-transparent !p-0 !rounded-none !border-0 !shadow-none !h-auto jus