le="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="invisible grid grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 [[data-state=open]&gt;&amp;]:visible [[data-state=open]&gt;&amp;]:grid-rows-[1fr] [[data-state=open]&gt;&amp;]:opacity-100"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="pt-0 text-xs [&amp;_a]:underline pb-2 hide-during-screenshot"><p>AA-Omniscience Index (higher is better) measures knowledge reliability and hallucination. It rewards correct answers, penalizes hallucinations, and has no penalty for refusing to answer. Scores range from -100 to 100, where 0 means as many correct as incorrect answers, and negative scores mean more incorrect than correct.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_qf8ltabsrb_-trigger-omniscience-accuracy" hidden="" id="radix-_R_qf8ltabsrb_-content-omniscience-accuracy" tabindex="0" class="mt-0 ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 pt-5 pb-8 px-8"></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_qf8ltabsrb_-trigger-omniscience-hallucination-rate" hidden="" id="radix-_R_qf8ltabsrb_-content-omniscience-hallucination-rate" tabindex="0" class="mt-0 ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 pt-5 pb-8 px-8"></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h3 class="text-2xl font-brand-serif flex items-baseline gap-2"><a class="hover:underline underline-offset-4" href="/evaluations/gdpval-aa">GDPval-AA v2.1</a><span class="rounded-full cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-brand-sans font-normal text-xs underline decoration-dotted text-brand-purple-dark" data-state="closed">Updated</sp